        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "浮き草（スピロデラ・ポリリザ）は小型の水草で、池沼の水面を覆うように増殖する。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "生物の授業で浮き草の葉状体と根の構造を顕微鏡で観察した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "水質浄化の実験に浮き草が使われ、窒素やリンの吸収効果が確かめられた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "precarious",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "定職もなく各地を転々とする浮き草のような暮らしに、ふと孤独を感じた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼の生活はまるで浮き草で、今夜どこに泊まるかも決まっていなかった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "故郷を離れて都会に出てきたものの、浮き草のような毎日がずっと続いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
